&_nc_oc=Adp7EoQnIRN3yaPBV0M1dEdeSApH_Ctzug0ZWdFyQudxRmA3JnCc-fm4FROyEq2iI8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTe9LrH4BBhGwrRZtuRlL4Gutv4HsBEiC6dr218zbDQqA&oe=6AF729BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ddH42iJA9XUQ7kNvwG-facG&_nc_oc=AdrRiD_a9lTZ0dMuySrYg2aCLvGeN3bbu7FCjsiosebEUJoMID0KIF-bnzNi4etQ1ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5x8pLpYb6sbk1GvoaG6qUnXfRjnJvl_X8USoyTJkZaA&oe=6AF73ABC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fwdcZkKE-qsQ7kNvwGM0_8k&_nc_oc=AdpyFDr57UsXkQmAadxVXQOxA4t2CMP7ZY8HxSamP7FQqnCSsIDuGUXsy6tSeJkQ_dE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSpupYHQAglexUBJBUG4CHA-bdTWmAA0OWDvirV4z6tAw&oe=6AF72107"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qTImu8QcRigQ7kNvwHC85D-&_nc_oc=Adokp75_sInVixW4mVoXs2loEY8hDliHPwv1IaHwNt9AsZRZblIkmFbUBeEYFWCM1Qw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRJA_ESurmfjOGJJCd5hYI2tzeeigjj7f2XFIq7imSSnQ&oe=6AF74515"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZNktBZGX_DwQ7kNvwHR-Kxe&_nc_oc=AdqY-ZgLvt2NXAaeOEyV-DffTpt2uunooQUXAeJjr0wOQPKPko0pQm3QIB1bRU8QP6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT4NrhWxbyczGRIdR98itI0On-DtrnRpsVe9niWXwy3jg&oe=6AF71964"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.